cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this benchmark or its results, please cite it as below.
type: software
title: "rerank-bench: rerankers compared on MIRACL and BRIGHT StackOverflow"
abstract: >-
  Rerankers compared on identical candidates: a System One classifier, LLMs used as relevance
  judges, and dedicated rerankers, hosted and local. Each reorders 24 candidates per question
  from MIRACL (six languages) and BRIGHT StackOverflow, seeing them the way Stuga's judge does.
  Code, candidates and every call's result are included.
authors:
  - name: Stuga
    website: https://stuga.dev
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.23089854
repository-code: https://github.com/stuga-dev/rerank-bench
url: https://stuga.dev/blog/reranking-with-a-classifier
license: MIT
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-10-01
keywords:
  - reranking
  - information retrieval
  - benchmark
  - LLM as judge
  - MIRACL
  - BRIGHT
